---
import {mosaicoAssemblyParts} from '../data/mosaico-bom';
---
<section class="mosaico-hardware" aria-labelledby="mosaico-hardware-heading">
 <div class="mosaico-hardware-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">BUILD 11 / TRUE HARDWARE BOM</span><h3 id="mosaico-hardware-heading">Four components. One compatible system.</h3></div><span class="mosaico-kit-label">VISION COMBO CONTAINS 3 MODULES</span></div>
 <p>The original software repository lists a device and camera requirement, rather than a commercial parts catalog. This independently researched BOM uses the manufacturer's hardware documentation. The recommended Vision Combo Kit already contains the core, camera, and interaction boards—<strong>do not order all three again if you select the kit</strong>.</p>
 <div class="mosaico-parts-grid">
 {mosaicoAssemblyParts.map((part,i)=><article class="mosaico-part">
   <div class="mosaico-part-art"><img src={part.image} width="600" height="460" loading="lazy" alt={part.slug==='usb-c-data-cable'?'Illustration of a USB-C data cable':'Independent component schematic illustration, not a verified product photo'}/></div>
   <div class="mosaico-part-information">
     <span class="mosaico-part-sequence">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {part.includedInVisionCombo?'INCLUDED IN VISION COMBO':'SEPARATE ACCESSORY'}</span>
     <h4>{part.title}</h4>
     <p>{part.role}</p><small>{part.details}</small>
     <div class="mosaico-part-tags"><span>{part.requiredForOriginalDemo?'Required':'Optional for core workflow'}</span><span>Qty {part.quantity}</span></div>
     <button type="button" class="mosaico-part-add" data-cart-add data-cart-slug={part.slug} data-cart-option="Option pending" data-cart-quantity={part.quantity} aria-label={'Save '+part.title+' as a standalone research component'}>Add individually to research cart +</button>
   </div>
 </article>)}
 </div>
 <div class="mosaico-shopping-method">
  <div><strong>Option A · Recommended kit</strong><p>ESP-Mosaico Vision Combo Kit + one data cable. One kit contains all three modules. Exact camera revision, cable inclusion, freight and U.S. orderability remain unverified.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-cart-add-all="mosaico-learning-assistant">ADD COMBO KIT + DATA CABLE →</button></div>
  <div><strong>Option B · Separate components</strong><p>Core Unit + H2 camera + Interaction Module + USB-C data cable. Standalone AliExpress options have not been verified; this builds a research list only.</p><button class="btn btn-outline" type="button" data-cart-add-plan="mosaico-learning-assistant">SAVE 4 INDIVIDUAL COMPONENTS →</button></div>
 </div>
 <p class="project-price-note">Parts subtotal: <strong>Price pending.</strong> U.S. delivery, shipping charge, returns and exact individual variants are not verified. This is a parts-planning cart, not payment checkout.</p>
 <p class="mosaico-qualification-note"><strong>Compatibility gate:</strong> The current official camera uses SC101IOT (V1.4). Original published learning firmware requires Recovery ABI 1/layout 4, and camera driver compatibility with the current kit has not been proven. No ready-to-use English firmware is included.</p>
 <p class="mosaico-qualification-note"><strong>Not included in any physical kit:</strong> 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi, cloud-model account/API charges, personal computer/phone for setup, and commercial software rights.</p>
</section>
